# Line endings: LF for every text file, on every platform (docs/guidelines/models.md 9.4 W3).
# CRLF would change the SHA-256 that the model pipeline, the manual and the lock compute over these files,
# and a shell script with CRLF does not run under WSL or Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Shell scripts must keep LF even where core.autocrlf is set. Set the executable bit (git update-index --chmod=+x) when committing them.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary files are never converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gguf binary
*.safetensors binary
*.onnx binary
